ind":"announcement","title":"Faraway Galaxy is heading to Next Fest","summary":"Steam Next Fest is just around the corner and we are happy to join in. After a few weeks of closed beta testing we gathered all your feedback, improved the onboarding and the UX, and even added a gamepad support. And now it’s time to announce that the Faraway Galaxy DEMO has been released!Here are some highlights:The demo scope covers one full campaign: dozens of enemies, a multitude of action cards and several random events to play through. You can already notice the core of the combat system a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:45:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4018980-1846018067944002","game_id":"steam-4018980","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest: making Faraway Galaxy better, faster, and stronger","summary":"Hi, fellow adventurers!Last week we launched the playtest of Faraway Galaxy to make sure it's ready for the Next Fest. Thanks to everyone who joined us, and special thanks to those who shared their feedback! So, how did it go, what have we learned, and how we improved the game?During the first day alone, 20% of the players decided to share their feedback. It’s a great ratio, and we appreciate your passion. We read all the reviews! And we made sure that the form is short enough but still answers ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:24:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944002","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4018980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":